      "created_at": null,
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/87cf27fa0c824951a0324e11643fe6a3dbf4b053",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "747b1b56f0221560839451aaa94771b935ae6267",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/747b1b56f0221560839451aaa94771b935ae6267"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 747b1b56f0221560839451aaa94771b935ae6267\nparent 70d9ec7f3d452789d04dce81dc02db0b3b778bb5\nauthor Andrew Toth <andrewstoth@gmail.com> 1784136231 -0400\ncommitter Andrew Toth <andrewstoth@gmail.com> 1784237930 -0400\n\ncoins: filter coinbase txid from parallel input fetching\n\nAn non-segwit invalid block could spend its own coinbase output. In that case we would want to skip fetching the coinbase prevout since it would already be in the CoinsViewOverlay's cache and would cause block validation to revert to synchronous fetching.\n\nCo-authored-by: Pieter Wuille <pieter@wuille.net>\n",
